  "details": "1. Open VRChat and have OSC active\n\n2. Send an Osc Packet containing an Osc Message, with a path that contains UTF encoded characters. E.g. `/avatar/parameters/\\u206c`\n\n3. Do the above, but wrap the packet (or multiple packets) in a Osc Bundle.\n\n4. Only Osc Packets sent in step 2 will be processed. Osc Packets from step 3 will be ignored.\n\nThis was found as part of developing DexProtect0SCRS (an alternate OSC Application for https://dextrovr.gumroad.com/l/DexProtect )\n\nwhen `self.dex_use_bundles` is true, the app is sending one OSC Bundle (like in step 3).\n\nif `self.dex_use_bundles` is false, the app sends multiple OSC Messages instead (like in step 2).\n\n \n\nhttps://github.com/C0D3-M4513R/DexProtectOscRS/blob/2a449c68653e1e83cf6e0347bebc89b3d7d52a96/app/src/osc/dex.rs#L191",
